Author:     Magnus Melin <mkmelin+mozilla@iki.fi>
AuthorDate: Tue Jun 23 16:28:05 2026 -0700
Commit:     Magnus Melin <mkmelin+mozilla@iki.fi>
CommitDate: Tue Jun 23 16:28:05 2026 -0700

    Bug 2022873 - restructure lazy cal. services. r=darktrojan


    CalStartupService was only ensuring timezone service initializes timezones before the calendar manager runs.
    That now happens by importing timezoneservice there.

    Localization service was a remaint from the lightning days.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D295631

